          "id": 1255749018,
          "type": null,
          "body": "Sure, the packet is encrypted so you'll need to specify the following key in \"Protocol Preferences > IEEE 802.15.4 Low-Rate Wireless PAN > Decryption Keys...\".\n\n| Description key                               |Decryption key index|Key hash|\n------------------------------------------------|--------------------|--------|\n|db:9a:ab:32:24:6b:6a:82:7a:16:05:27:1a:27:84:53| 5                  |No hash |\n\n[nd-earo.pcap](/uploads/8be2f4193f0deb2ebcdb5e910390187b/nd-earo.pcap)\n\n\nI also just pushed a second commit which updates status messages for EARO.",
