      "title": "Update ICMPv6 dissector for ND EARO",
      "message": "Update ICMPv6 dissector for ND EARO\n\nRFC 8505 introduces the Extended Address Registration Option (EARO)\nwhich uses some previously reserved fields from the Neighbor Discovery\nAddress Registration Option (ARO) defined in RFC 6775.\n\nhttps://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc8505#section-4.1\nhttps://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc6775#section-4.1\n",
      "author_name": "Mathis Marion",
      "author_email": "mathis.marion@silabs.com",
      "authored_date": "2023-01-27T13:58:35.000+01:00",
      "committer_name": "John Thacker",
      "committer_email": "johnthacker@gmail.com",
      "committed_date": "2023-01-30T13:28:52.000+00:00",
